    "sections": {
        "description": "The Bridal Store WordPress Theme is a beautifully designed, user-friendly template created for bridal boutiques, wedding planners, and related businesses. Its elegant and responsive design is perfect for showcasing gowns, accessories, bridesmaid dresses, and groom’s attire. This theme supports a range of wedding services, from planning and photography to makeup and destination events. With built-in WooCommerce integration, setting up an online shop or service listing is quick and easy Visual storytelling takes center stage with full-width banners, image carousels, video backgrounds, and testimonials that create a romantic, immersive experience. Flexible layouts let you highlight inspiration, venues, hairstyles, and more—tailored to suit any wedding style. Whether you're building a vendor site, save-the-date page, or blog, this theme helps you present your offerings clearly and beautifully. It’s also equipped to organize services like decor, catering, flowers, and entertainment, offering a seamless journey for your visitors from start to finish."
    },
